{
  "note": "The rules that app.js, the verify/ pipeline and the tests must all agree on, in ONE place. Before Sep 2026 each of these was hand-copied into Python, the page and the test files, with a 'must stay in step' comment as the only guard - and the near-override ordering bug was the guard failing. app.js fetches this at boot beside loot_data.json; fetch_bis.py, check_bis.py, check_priority.py and seed_priority.py load it; test/*.mjs read it directly. Nothing derives any of these at runtime.",

  "phases": [
