  "variantsNote": "The closed vocabulary a BiS entry's `variant` may use, and how each reads. `label` null means the word is suppressed on screen. `emphasis` means the wording emphasises rather than qualifies, so it never makes a ring dashed. `tankSet` means a tank's threat/mitigation kit - two genuine sets, not a caveat - so it is not conditional on a spec whose roles include Tank. `uncontested` means the row does not compete for slot capacity: it states a margin, not a condition under which the row wins.",
  "variants": {
